# Merge after mgk_64_k66_defconfig and mt6893_overlay.config.
# Experimental Nord 2 board profile; hardware validation is pending.
# This is not a complete or flashable kernel configuration.

# LK selects AMS643YE05 on the tested DN2103 board.
